  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Unit 7, Favorites, Page 26, Track 36, Listening 1, 1, Sorry, I can't go out tonight.",
      "start": 0.11,
      "end": 14.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'm staying home to watch the world's greatest talent.",
      "start": 14.02,
      "end": 17.16
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Really? Huh, I've never seen that.",
      "start": 17.16,
      "end": 20.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You're kidding, you have to watch it. Tonight's the finals. Everyone's gonna be watching it.",
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 26.96
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, okay, maybe I will.",
      "start": 26.96,
      "end": 29.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Two.",
      "start": 29.72,
      "end": 33.63
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Isn't she amazing?",
      "start": 33.63,
      "end": 36.13
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yeah, she has a beautiful voice.",
      "start": 36.13,
      "end": 39.39
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And she writes such great songs.",
      "start": 39.39,
      "end": 42.35
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yeah, she's so creative. Three.",
      "start": 42.35,
      "end": 47.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "She's incredible.",
      "start": 47.94,
      "end": 50.04
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yeah, she's the best.",
      "start": 50.04,
      "end": 51.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Did you know she started playing when she was only two years old?",
      "start": 51.8,
      "end": 55.08
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Two. I was still learning to walk at that age.",
      "start": 55.08,
      "end": 58.66
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yeah, and she started playing professionally when she was only sixteen.",
      "start": 58.66,
      "end": 63.32
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And I think she scored something like a hundred goals in her professional career.",
      "start": 63.32,
      "end": 68.82
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Four.",
      "start": 68.82,
      "end": 70.3
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What are you doing? Studying?",
      "start": 70.3,
      "end": 72.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, sort of. I'm taking a little break.",
      "start": 72.8,
      "end": 76.44
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hey, take a look at this. It's really cool.",
      "start": 76.44,
      "end": 79.08
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You have to sneak past the guards and shoot King Everest to get to the next level.",
      "start": 79.08,
      "end": 83.52
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I only started playing it a few days ago and I've already gotten to the fourth level.",
      "start": 83.52,
      "end": 87.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Awesome. Can I have a turn?",
      "start": 87.36,
      "end": 90.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'll bet I can get to the fourth level on my first try.",
      "start": 90.94,
      "end": 96.65
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Five.",
      "start": 96.65,
      "end": 97.91
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hey, Sam. Wanna go to Giovanni's tonight?",
      "start": 97.91,
      "end": 101.75
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Giovanni's? I don't think I've ever been there.",
      "start": 101.75,
      "end": 105.09
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You haven't? They have the best pizza in the world.",
      "start": 105.09,
      "end": 109.89
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They do? Well, then let's go right now.",
      "start": 109.89,
      "end": 112.99
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'm really hungry. Six.",
      "start": 112.99,
      "end": 117.79
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Can you change the station? Let's listen to 97.9.",
      "start": 117.79,
      "end": 122.57
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, come on. I want to listen to this sports talk show.",
      "start": 122.57,
      "end": 126.43
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What's so great about 97.9 anyway?",
      "start": 126.43,
      "end": 129.69
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, they play the top hits. Only new stuff.",
      "start": 129.69,
      "end": 133.09
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Right. Only the top hits. Don't you get tired of listening to the same ten songs all day?",
      "start": 133.09,
      "end": 139.91
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "No, not if they're my favorite songs.",
